[31.95, "o", "---\r\nproposal_id: proposal_92fccb82\r\noperation: merge_entities\r\nstatus: pending\r\nconfidence: medium\r\nmodel_snapshot: claude-sonnet-4-6\r\nkept_id: thematic_code_lack_of_transparency\r\nremoved_id: thematic_code_feeling_shut_out\r\nrationale: 'Both codes capture the same atomic construct: a participant''s\r\n  subjective sense of being excluded from information about their own data.'\r\nevidence:\r\n- It just feels like decisions about my information happen behind closed doors...\r\n- I just felt completely shut out, like nobody was telling me what was actually going on...\r\n---\r\r\n"]
